  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium 365\n\t\tCapium 365 (Mobile App)\n\n### Capium 365 - Documents\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 22 Oct, 2024 at  2:42 PM\n\nWelcome to our Guide for Documents in Capium 365! This guide will walk you through essential initial steps, best practices and key features within Documents.\n\nHow to find document requests\n\nClick on the three dashes in the top right-hand corner of the screen\nNavigate to the “Documents” Tab\nSelect “Requests”\n\nFolders\n\nCapium 365 offers two different folders:\n\nGeneral – Folder for your personal use\nShared with me – Shared folder between you and your accountant\n\nYou can create new folders for your personal use: To do this, you need to:\n\nClick on the three dashes in the top right-hand corner of the screen\nNavigate to the “Documents” Tab\nSelect “Drive”\nClick the “+” in the bottom right-hand corner of the screen\nSelect the “Folder +” icon in the bottom right-left hand corner of the screen\nType in the fo\n\nYou can star folders which will be shown in the drive and the starred tab.\n\nHow to upload documents\n\nNavigate to the “Documents” Tab\nSelect “Drive”\nSelect the folder\nSelect the add icon\nSelect the file icon to upload the file\n\nYou can export folders. To do this you need to:\n\nNavigate to the “Documents” Tab\nSelect “Drive”\nSelect the three dots in the right-hand corner\nSelect between Excel, CSV or PDF Format\n\nHow to delete a file\n\nNavigate to the “Documents” tab\nSelect “Drive”\nSelect the folder\nSelect the three dots on the right-hand side\nSelect “Delete”\n\nThe deleted files can be found in the “Trash” section where they will remain for 30 days.\n\nYou can restore deleted files. To do this, you need to:\n\nNavigate to the “Documents” Tab\nSelect the trash icon in the left panel\nSelect the three dots on the right-hand side\nSelect “Restore”\n\nThe document will be restored to its original folder.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000118596\">Capium 365</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000200746\">Capium 365 (Mobile App)</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Capium 365 - Documents\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Tue, 22 Oct, 2024 at  2:42 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><span class=\"fr-video fr-deletable fr-fvc fr-dvb fr-draggable\"></span></p><div style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 222.22222222222223%; height: 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/501967e6e1bf46539f055fde826cf7df?sid=45fbe703-2faa-493b-875e-e3eba976404c\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation\"></iframe></div><p></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Welcome to our Guide for Documents in Capium 365! This guide will walk you through essential initial steps, best practices and key features within Documents.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><strong><u>How to find document requests</u></strong></p><ol start=\"1\" style=\"margin-botto