f;\">Click on the three dashes in the top right-hand corner of the screen</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Navigate to the “Documents” Tab</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Select “Drive”</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Click the “+” in the bottom right-hand corner of the screen</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Select the “Folder +” icon in the bottom right-left hand corner of the screen</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Type in the fo</li></ol><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">You can star folders which will be shown in the drive and the starred tab.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><strong><u>How to upload documents</u></strong></p><ol start=\"1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\" type=\"1\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Navigate to the “Documents” Tab</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Select “Drive”</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Select the folder</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Select the add icon</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Select the file icon to upload the file</li></ol><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">You can export folders. To do this you need to:</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><ol start=\"1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\" type=\"1\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Navigate to the “Documents” Tab</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Select “Drive”</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Select the three dots in the right-hand corner</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Select between Excel, CSV or PDF Format</li></ol><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><strong><u>How to delete a file</u></strong></p><ol start=\"1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\" type=\"1\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Navigate to the “Documents” tab</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Select “Drive”</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Select the folder</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Select the three dots on the right-hand side</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Select “Delete”</li></ol><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">The deleted files can be found in the “Trash” section where they will remain for 30 days.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">You can restore deleted files. To do this, you need to:</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><ol start=\"1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\" type=\"1\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Navigate to the “Documents” Tab</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Select the trash icon in the left panel</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Select the three dots on the right-hand side</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Select “Restore”</li></ol><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">The document will be restored to its original folder.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000246968\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000246968/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000246968\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000246968/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000246968\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-feedback-form-link\" data-hide-dom=\"#vote-feedback-form-link\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">Send feedback</a><div id=\"vote-feedback-container\"class=\"hide\">\t<div class=\"lead\">Sorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.</div>\t<div id=\"vote-feedback-form\">\t\t<div class=\"sloading loading-small loading-b